/80px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%BC%BA%E6%95%88%E5%85%85%E8%83%BD%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d0/k3rcnmz2d5wie6nd6cwxm461pg19m0j.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%BC%BA%E6%95%88%E5%85%85%E8%83%BD%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d0/k3rcnmz2d5wie6nd6cwxm461pg19m0j.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />强效充能核心\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">1级效果</span>]，拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"刺刀充能\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">刺刀充能</font></span></span>]时，单体攻击[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"倒吊人标记\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">倒吊人标记</font></span></span>]的敌人，物攻提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，暴击率、暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"刺刀充能\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">刺刀充能</font></span></span>]时，单体攻击[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"倒吊人标记\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">倒吊人标记</font></span></span>]的敌人，物攻提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>，暴击率、暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>。攻击后回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"刺刀充能\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">刺刀充能</font></span></span>]时，单体攻击[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"倒吊人标记\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">倒吊人标记</font></span></span>]的敌人，物攻提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>，暴击率、暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>。攻击后回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"远见之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f1/3cci05qpyelokxmo1facd15gigt8ao7.png/40px-%E8%BF%9C%E8%A7%81%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f1/3cci05qpyelokxmo1facd15gigt8ao7.png/60px-%E8%BF%9C%E8%A7%81%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f1/3cci05qpyelokxmo1facd15gigt8ao7.png/80px-%E8%BF%9C%E8%A7%81%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，二级：60<img alt=\"远见之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f1/3cci05qpyelokxmo1facd15gigt8ao7.png/40px-%E8%BF%9C%E8%A7%81%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f1/3cci05qpyelokxmo1facd15gigt8ao7.png/60px-%E8%BF%9C%E8%A7%81%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f1/3cci05qpyelokxmo1facd15gigt8ao7.png/80px-%E8%BF%9C%E8%A7%81%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /> 20<img alt=\"希望之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ea/kq40wrxv8xclezkb34moo3400yy7dha.png/40px-%E5%B8%8C%E6%9C%9B%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ea/kq40wrxv8xclezkb34moo3400yy7dha.png/60px-%E5%B8%8C%E6%9C%9B%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ea/